---
title: "Issue #59 - Enforce product ID when deleting a product variant (UML Class Diagram)"
---
classDiagram
  direction TB

  %% ---------- HTTP layer ----------
  class VariantRoute {
    <<route module: admin/products/[id]/variants/[variant_id]/route.ts>>
    +GET(req, res) existing
    +POST(req, res) existing
    +DELETE(req, res) MODIFIED
  }

  class AuthenticatedMedusaRequest {
    <<framework/http>>
    +params : id, variant_id
    +scope : MedusaContainer
    +queryConfig : fields
  }

  class refetchEntity {
    <<framework/http utility>>
    +refetchEntity(entity, idOrFilter, scope, fields) Promise~Entity~
  }

  class Query {
    <<framework>>
    +graph(entity, filters, fields)
  }

  class errorHandler {
    <<framework middleware>>
    +NOT_FOUND maps to 404
    +INVALID_DATA maps to 400
  }

  class Error

  class MedusaError {
    +type : NOT_FOUND
    +message : string
  }

  %% ---------- Workflow layer ----------
  class deleteProductVariantsWorkflow {
    <<core-flows workflow>>
    +input : ids string[]
    +run(input)
  }

  class deleteProductVariantsStep {
    <<core-flows step>>
    +invoke(ids)
    +compensate(ids)
  }

  %% ---------- Module layer ----------
  class IProductModuleService {
    <<interface>>
    +softDeleteProductVariants(ids)
  }

  class MedusaService {
    <<modules-sdk>>
    generated CRUD methods
  }

  class ProductModuleService {
    +softDeleteProductVariants(ids)
  }

  class Product {
    <<data model>>
    +id : string
    +variants : hasMany
  }

  class ProductVariant {
    <<data model>>
    +id : string
    +product_id : string
  }

  %% ---------- Tests ----------
  class VariantDeleteSpec {
    <<integration test: variant.spec.ts>>
    +deletes variant under its own product
    +404 for variant under another product
    +404 for nonexistent variant
    +404 for already-deleted variant
  }

  %% ---------- Relationships ----------
  VariantRoute ..> AuthenticatedMedusaRequest : reads params
  VariantRoute ..> refetchEntity : NEW guard lookup id + product_id
  VariantRoute ..> MedusaError : NEW throws NOT_FOUND
  VariantRoute ..> deleteProductVariantsWorkflow : run ids
  refetchEntity --> Query : delegates to
  Query ..> ProductModuleService : resolves variant
  errorHandler ..> MedusaError : converts to HTTP status
  Error <|-- MedusaError
  deleteProductVariantsWorkflow "1" *-- "1..*" deleteProductVariantsStep : composed of
  deleteProductVariantsStep ..> IProductModuleService : resolves and calls
  IProductModuleService <|.. ProductModuleService
  MedusaService <|-- ProductModuleService
  ProductModuleService --> ProductVariant : manages
  Product "1" *-- "0..*" ProductVariant : variants
  VariantDeleteSpec ..> VariantRoute : calls over HTTP

  %% ---------- Annotations ----------
  note for VariantRoute "(1) Guard lives in the route: it is the only layer\nthat has both IDs from the URL. It runs before the\nworkflow, so a mismatch deletes nothing.\nThe old TODO and commented-out product_id are removed."
  note for refetchEntity "(2) One lookup by id + product_id. Mismatched,\nnonexistent and already-deleted variants all return\nnothing, so they all get the same 404.\nSame scoping GET and POST in this file already use."
  note for deleteProductVariantsWorkflow "(3) Deliberately unchanged: a public core-flows API\nthat other code calls. Input stays ids only, so the\nproduct check could not go here without an API change."
  note for ProductModuleService "(4) softDeleteProductVariants silently ignores unknown\nIDs. This is why the old route answered\n200 deleted true for variants that did not exist."
  note for Product "(5) Composition: variants cannot exist without their\nproduct and are cascade-deleted with it. product_id\nis the link the fix now enforces."
  note for errorHandler "(6) The route never sets a status code. Throwing\nMedusaError NOT_FOUND is mapped to 404 centrally."
  note for VariantDeleteSpec "Legend: amber = new or modified in this issue,\nnavy = existing code. Dashed arrow = dependency,\nsolid arrow = association, filled diamond = composition,\nhollow triangle = inheritance or realization."

  %% ---------- Styling ----------
  classDef existing fill:#e8edf5,stroke:#1e3461,color:#1e3461
  classDef changed fill:#fdf3dc,stroke:#c48a1e,stroke-width:3px,color:#5c3d00

  cssClass "AuthenticatedMedusaRequest,refetchEntity,Query,errorHandler,Error,MedusaError,deleteProductVariantsWorkflow,deleteProductVariantsStep,IProductModuleService,MedusaService,ProductModuleService,Product,ProductVariant" existing
  cssClass "VariantRoute,VariantDeleteSpec" changed
